{"id":8483579,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/merge_requests/3549","number":3549,"state":"merged","title":"fix conv2dv2 dma scene error when cin is always tail","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-nn/pulls/3549","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-nn/pulls/3549/issues","body":"## 描述\n【问题背景】：dma场景用例执行时，输出出现概率性nan情况\n【问题根因】：gm2ub搬运时当cinIter每一个均为tail时，存在loopSize错误使用k0而非ciTail，导致搬运时未按照实际间隔搬运，可能导致ub上读取到的值为超大值，最终导致计算结果超大\n【修改方案】：\nLoadGM2UB时通过cinAL1Iter、vecCi1Iter判断当前ci循环是否存在tail\n<!--在这里详细描述你的改动，包括改动的原因和所采取的方法。-->\n\n## 关联的Issue\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的Issue，请在这里提供Issue链接。例如：关联Issue #000-->\n[#1934](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/issues/1934) \n\n## 测试\n<!--描述进行了哪些测试来验证你的改动。-->\ndma场景线上用例通过，本地执行用例通过\nfmap（1， 3， 32， 32）weight（3， 1， 32， 32）padding（0， 0， 0， 0）stride（64， 64）dilation（1， 1）\ndtype: float16\nformat: NCHW\n\n## 文档更新\n<!--如果这个PR包含文档的更新，请在这里指出。例如：更新了README.md文件。-->\n不涉及\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n","assignees_number":3,"assignees":[{"id":"68d55468c9e33e3d8f4119c6","login":"Andy-lb","name":"Andy-lb","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Andy-lb","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68d645601331e546a263edb0","login":"gcw_Dm2TsRUi","name":"mizhenkun","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gcw_Dm2TsRUi","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68d502180329437872e54496","login":"gcw_kUomxQ2l","name":"liulun0308","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gcw_kUomxQ2l","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false}],"testers":[],"approval_reviewers":[{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong","assignee":false,"code_owner":false,"accept":false,"accept_status":"pending"},{"id":"6880d13aba419813105ac7ab","login":"tangweiwei2","name":"tangweiwei2","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2","assignee":false,"code_owner":false,"accept":fa